    "sex": "Male",
    "height": "6'10",
    "skinTone": "Light Grey",
    "background": "Chakka drew his first breath in a kaer that was meant to keep its people safe — until slavers cracked it open and dragged them into the light. Torn from his family before he was old enough to hold their faces in memory, he was shackled aboard a Theran airship and sold into slavery. For two years he laboured under a Theran dwarf, swallowing his rage and biding his time. When fate finally left the door to freedom unguarded, Chakka threw himself through it with everything he had — and he has never once looked back.",
